Definitions.-(1) In these regulations, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means the Insurance Act, 1938 (
4 of 1938
);
(b)
"Actuarial Society of India" means Actuarial Society of India constituted under Societies Registration Act, 1860 (21 of
1860);
(c)
"Actuary" means an individual possessing such qualifications as specified in regulation 3;
(d)
"Authority" means Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority established under the Insurance Regulatory and
Development Authority Act, 1999 (
41 of 1999
);
(2)
All words and expressions used and not defined herein shall have the meanings respectively assigned to them in the
Insurance Act, 1938 (
4 of 1938
) or in the Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority Act, 1999 (
41 of 1999
), or in the regulations made thereunder.
